          "topic": "Scope",
          "instructions": "A fictional service business with a current-approach baseline and three proposed growth commitments and one standardized package. Edit the explicit case values; adapt the app for other commitments, payment structures, activity dependencies or services."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Starting values",
          "instructions": "Prefilled values are fictional examples. Changing part of the workbook can leave example inputs in the case."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Editing",
          "instructions": "Edit the named input sheets. Keep worksheet names, column headers and record identifiers. Do not add formulas. Other case inputs remain unchanged."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Units and time",
          "instructions": "Whole elapsed days from the declared planning origin; event order distinguishes payments within a day. Monetary inputs use integer USD cents, displayed as dollars where labelled. Opening cash is unrestricted incremental growth funding after existing obligations. Reserve funds are deducted by the cash-balance requirement once. Forecast sales and collection dates are supplied assumptions, not predictions."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Import",
          "instructions": "Upload this workbook, inspect the changes and diagnostics, then apply. Importing does not calculate results or establish operating permission."
        },
